-- title:
--   Rational logarithm certificates for the concrete DWZ (2,5,1) entropy rate
-- statement:
--   These are explicit rational logarithm intervals for the 108 nontrivial positive arguments of the concrete six-region $(2,5,1)$ fine profile (coarse marginals, joint two-letter words, and pooled compatibility masses). Each certificate records the argument, a power-of-two scale reduction, a finite-series length, and rational lower and upper logarithm bounds; the derived rational lower bounds of the three rate branches are defined here.
-- source:
--   Released q=5 fourth-power certificate (object 161), with the canonical coupled child profiles of mme_dwz_fourth_coupled63_canonical_row_data and exact half-half elementary child profiles.

